     "attendanceForecast": null,
     "token": "317510470",
     "title": "Around the World | Free Hybrid Toastmasters Open House",
     "description": "🌍 **Five Languages. One Evening.**\nWant to feel more confident speaking up at work, giving a presentation, or talking in front of a group? Get a head start on your 2027 goals at this free District 46 Toastmasters open house. Join us on Zoom or in person near Bryant Park, NYC.\n\n👉 **Reserve your spot.** Complete the Zoom registration form and select **online** or **in person**, even if you’ve already RSVP’d on Meetup.\n[https://bit.ly/ATW46](https://bit.ly/ATW46)\n\nToastmasters is a community where people practice public speaking and get supportive feedback. You’ll meet members of New York’s bilingual Toastmasters clubs and experience **Hindi, Arabic, Mandarin, Spanish, and Japanese alongside English** through speeches and stories.\nTry a short impromptu speaking activity or simply listen and enjoy. First-time guests are welcome. Bring a friend, and feel free to wear traditional attire!\n\n📅 **Friday, December 11, 2026**\n🤝 **6:15 PM ET** · In-person networking\n🎤 **6:30 PM ET** · Open house begins for everyone\n\n**Food will be served for in-person guests.** There are **30 in-person spots**, and we’ll share the exact address near Bryant Park after you register.",
